      "sourceTextSha256": "5626cfc789773b24100c9ca36eca4cdeee9e9400987dfef4d036f074ec6a70d0",
      "text": "Day 12 · Breakfast and, at 08:00, boat tour to the Ballestas Islands, often called the “Little Galápagos”: penguins, sea lions and many seabirds, and with luck dolphins. On the way, see the Paracas Candelabra, a giant ancient geoglyph on the hillside above the shore. In the afternoon, bus back to Lima and check-in at the hotel.",
